  <desc>Every posted invoice not yet paid: view, reprint, fax, cancel or
  take payment.</desc>
    <credit type="author">
      <name>Reuben Rissler</name>
      <email>pygtk.posting@gmail.com</email>
    </credit>
  </info>

  <title>Unpaid invoices</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Customer</gui><gui>Unpaid invoices</gui></guiseq>, or the
  <gui>Unpaid Invoices</gui> button of the main window, lists every posted
  invoice that is not yet paid. Below the list, <gui>Unpaid invoices</gui> is
  their total and <gui>A/R balance</gui> is what all customers owe after their
  payments and credit memos.</p>

  <p>Double click an invoice to choose it. The buttons below the list then
  work on that invoice:</p>
  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>Mark as paid</gui></title>
    <p>Opens <link xref="customer_payment"/> for the invoice's
    customer.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>View invoice</gui></title>
    <p>Opens the invoice as it was printed when it was posted.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Edit invoice</gui></title>
    <p>Opens the invoice to change it; see <link xref="invoice#posted"/>.
    An invoice created more than 30 days ago opens with its date locked.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Cancel invoice</gui></title>
    <p>Asks for the date of the cancellation, then cancels the invoice: it is
    taken out of the books on that date, its stock goes back, and its serial
    numbers are freed. This cannot be undone.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Chart</gui></title>
    <p>A pie chart of what each customer owes.</p></item>
  </terms>

  <section id="right_click">
  <title>Right click an invoice</title>
  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>Contact hub</gui></title>
    <p>Everything about the invoice's customer; see <link
    xref="contact_hub"/>.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Fax invoice</gui></title>
    <p>Faxes the invoice exactly as it was printed when posted, after you
    confirm the number; see <link xref="fax"/>.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Reprint invoice</gui></title>
    <p>Prints the invoice as it was posted. Each reprint is counted in the
    <gui>Reprints</gui> column and kept.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Show reprint history</gui></title>
    <p>Lists the reprints of this customer's unpaid invoices, newest first.
    <gui>View PDF</gui> opens the selected reprint.</p></item>
  </terms>
  </section>

  <section id="menu">
  <title>The window menu</title>
  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>Customer invoices PDF</gui></title>
    <p>Puts the first page of each of the chosen customer's unpaid invoices
    into one PDF, four to a page, to send with a reminder. When it is built,
    <gui>View PDF</gui> opens it and <gui>Send via email</gui> opens <link
    xref="send_email"/> to the customer with it attached.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Save window layout</gui></title>
    <p>Remembers the window's size, column widths and sorting, on this
    computer.</p></item>
  </terms>
  </section>

</page>
